# Homelab provisioning environment package set (ADR 0049).
#
# Every entry is something bin/homelab-install shells out to, or something
# needed to reach the console over the network. If a package cannot be traced
# to a line in the installer, it does not belong here: this image is a public
# artifact and every package in it is attack surface on a machine that is
# about to be handed a disk to erase.

# The live environment itself --- kernel, firmware, and the archiso hooks that
# mount a root filesystem fetched over HTTP.
base
linux
linux-firmware
mkinitcpio
mkinitcpio-archiso
mkinitcpio-nfs-utils

# Disk layout --- disks.py
gptfdisk
parted
dosfstools
btrfs-progs
cryptsetup
util-linux

# Installing the target system
arch-install-scripts
systemd-ukify
sbctl

# The installer itself
python

# Network boot and reaching the artifact service
iproute2
iputils
curl
wget
openssh

# Diagnosis when something does not work at 2 a.m.
nano
less
lsof
pciutils
usbutils
dmidecode
tmux
